已根据 **Web Interface Guidelines** 编写了一个高质感、符合无障碍标准（Accessibility）、支持深色模式且性能优化的 `login.html`。

### 主要合规点说明：
1.  **无障碍 (Accessibility)**:
    *   所有表单控件均关联 `<label>`。
    *   图标按钮包含 `aria-label`。
    *   错误提示使用 `aria-live="polite"` 确保屏幕阅读器能读取。
    *   使用语义化标签 (`main`, `h1`, `form`)。
2.  **焦点状态 (Focus States)**:
    *   使用 `:focus-visible` 提供清晰的环形焦点指示器，避免鼠标点击时出现多余轮廓。
3.  **表单规范 (Forms)**:
    *   输入框包含正确的 `autocomplete` 属性 (`username`, `current-password`)。
    *   禁用邮箱/密码字段的拼写检查 (`spellcheck="false"`)。
    *   提交按钮在请求期间显示加载状态，并保持禁用防止重复提交。
    *   不阻止粘贴操作。
4.  **动画与性能 (Animation & Performance)**:
    *   仅对 `opacity` 和 `transform` 进行动画处理（合成器友好）。
    *   尊重 `prefers-reduced-motion`，在用户偏好减少动画时禁用过渡效果。
    *   字体使用 `font-display: swap` 防止 FOIT。
5.  **排版与内容 (Typography & Content)**:
    *   标题使用 `text-wrap: balance` 优化换行。
    *   省略号使用 Unicode 字符 `…` 而非三个点。
    *   文案使用主动语态和标题大小写 (Title Case)。
6.  **深色模式 (Dark Mode)**:
    *   通过 `color-scheme: dark` 和 CSS 变量自动适配系统主题。

### 代码实现

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login – Acme Corp</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Sign in to your Acme Corp account.">

    <!-- Preconnect for performance -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <!-- Font with display swap -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            /* Light Theme */
            --bg-color: #ffffff;
            --surface-color: #f9fafb;
            --border-color: #e5e7eb;
            --text-primary: #111827;
            --text-secondary: #6b7280;
            --primary-color: #2563eb;
            --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --error-color: #dc2626;
            --focus-ring: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);

            /* Spacing & Radius */
            --radius-md: 0.5rem;
            --radius-lg: 0.75rem;
            --spacing-sm: 0.5rem;
            --spacing-md: 1rem;
            --spacing-lg: 1.5rem;
            --spacing-xl: 2rem;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                color-scheme: dark;
                --bg-color: #111827;
                --surface-color: #1f2937;
                --border-color: #374151;
                --text-primary: #f9fafb;
                --text-secondary: #9ca3af;
                --primary-color: #3b82f6;
                --primary-hover: #60a5fa;
                --error-color: #ef4444;
                --focus-ring: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.5;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            /* Prevent scroll bounce on iOS */
            overscroll-behavior: contain;
        }

        .login-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            background-color: var(--surface-color);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: var(--spacing-xl);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
            text-wrap: balance;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
            /* Touch optimization */
            touch-action: manipulation;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        input::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Focus Visible State - Compliance with Guidelines */
        input:focus-visible {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--focus-ring);
        }

        /* Error State */
        input[aria-invalid="true"] {
            border-color: var(--error-color);
        }

        input[aria-invalid="true"]:focus-visible {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5);
        }

        .error-message {
            color: var(--error-color);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
            display: none;
        }

        .error-message.visible {
            display: block;
        }

        button[type="submit"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.625rem;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        button[type="submit"]:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-hover);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:focus-visible {
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--focus-ring);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:disabled {
            opacity: 0.7;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        /* Spinner Animation - Compositor Friendly */
        .spinner {
            width: 1rem;
            height: 1rem;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50%;
            border-top-color: white;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
            display: none;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* Respect Reduced Motion */
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, ::before, ::after {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
            }
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer-links a:focus-visible {
            outline: none;
            text-decoration: underline;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <main class="login-container">
        <h1>Sign In</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Welcome back! Please enter your details.</p>

        <form id="loginForm" novalidate>
            <!-- Email Field -->
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="email">Email Address</label>
                <input 
                    type="email" 
                    id="email" 
                    name="email" 
                    autocomplete="username" 
                    spellcheck="false"
                    placeholder="name@company.com…" 
                    required
                    aria-describedby="email-error"
                >
                <div id="email-error" class="error-message" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Password Field -->
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="password">Password</label>
                <input 
                    type="password" 
                    id="password" 
                    name="password" 
                    autocomplete="current-password" 
                    spellcheck="false"
                    placeholder="Enter your password…" 
                    required
                    aria-describedby="password-error"
                >
                <div id="password-error" class="error-message" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Submit Button -->
            <button type="submit" id="submitBtn">
                <span class="btn-text">Sign In</span>
                <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/forgot-password">Forgot Password?</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const form = document.getElementById('loginForm');
            const emailInput = document.getElementById('email');
            const passwordInput = document.getElementById('password');
            const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
            const btnText = submitBtn.querySelector('.btn-text');
            const spinner = submitBtn.querySelector('.spinner');

            // Helper to show error
            const showError = (input, message) => {
                const errorDiv = document.getElementById(`${input.id}-error`);
                input.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
                errorDiv.textContent = message;
                errorDiv.classList.add('visible');
            };

            // Helper to clear error
            const clearError = (input) => {
                const errorDiv = document.getElementById(`${input.id}-error`);
                input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
                errorDiv.textContent = '';
                errorDiv.classList.remove('visible');
            };

            // Real-time validation clearing
            [emailInput, passwordInput].forEach(input => {
                input.addEventListener('input', () => clearError(input));
            });

            form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
                e.preventDefault();

                // Reset errors
                clearError(emailInput);
                clearError(passwordInput);

                let hasError = false;

                // Simple Validation
                if (!emailInput.value || !emailInput.value.includes('@')) {
                    showError(emailInput, 'Please enter a valid email address.');
                    hasError = true;
                }

                if (!passwordInput.value) {
                    showError(passwordInput, 'Password is required.');
                    hasError = true;
                }

                if (hasError) {
                    // Focus first error field
                    const firstInvalid = form.querySelector('[aria-invalid="true"]');
                    if (firstInvalid) firstInvalid.focus();
                    return;
                }

                // Simulate API Request
                try {
                    // UI Loading State
                    submitBtn.disabled = true;
                    btnText.textContent = 'Signing In…';
                    spinner.style.display = 'block';

                    // Mock delay
                    await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1500));

                    // Success handling (Mock)
                    alert('Login successful!');

                } catch (error) {
                    showError(emailInput, 'An unexpected error occurred. Please try again.');
                } finally {
                    // Reset UI
                    submitBtn.disabled = false;
                    btnText.textContent = 'Sign In';
                    spinner.style.display = 'none';
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

